  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2d2f47;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --shadow: #0d0e17;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  border-radius: 1rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: min(100%, 360px);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n  min-width: 4.5rem;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffe08a;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA tiny offline counter with a pixel-style look. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser.\n\n- **+1** — increase the count by one.\n- **−1** — decrease the count by one (negative numbers are supported).\n- **Reset** — set the count back to zero.\n\nAll buttons are keyboard-accessible (Tab to focus, Enter/Space to activate) and have ARIA labels.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and required IDs (`count`, `increase`, `decrease`, `reset`).\n- `style.css` — responsive pixel-style theme.\n- `script.js` — counter logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Works from 360px width up.\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n- Only HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
